## The brief

Web Design South Wales needed a managed starter website with a visual style that would stand apart from standard agency websites. The brief called for a retro arcade look while still keeping the site clear, credible, and easy for South Wales businesses to understand.

## What we built

We created a fast managed starter website with a neon arcade-inspired interface, pixel-style typography, and a strong first impression above the fold. The design balances character with practical lead generation, using clear navigation, service pages, pricing information, and calls to action throughout.

The project was delivered on NC Digital's managed website setup, covering the website build, hosting, technical setup, and ongoing support.

## What's included

- Retro arcade-inspired website design
- Managed starter website build
- Fast hosting and technical setup
- Clear service and pricing structure
- Mobile responsive layout
- Ongoing support and updates

## Results

- Distinctive online presence for a South Wales web agency
- Memorable theme aligned with the client's brief
- Clear user journey from homepage to service enquiry
- Managed website foundation ready for future updates

This site runs on our [Managed Starter Website plan for South Wales businesses](/managed-starter-websites-south-wales/) with hosting, updates, and support included.

NC Digital provides [web design in South Wales](/web-design-south-wales/) for small businesses, local organisations, and service providers that need a professional website without the stress of managing everything themselves.
